      "writtenOn": "2023-04-11T15:45:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To simplify getting the `chunk.len()` \"first\" bytes of the 196-bit value in all cases.\n\nDid you have something like this in mind:\n\n```\nif let Some(word) \u003d words.next() {\n    let bytes \u003d r2.to_ne_bytes();\n    let offset \u003d bytes.len() - word.len();\n    word.clone_from_slices(\u0026bytes[offset..]);\n}\nif let Some(word) \u003d words.next() {\n    let bytes \u003d r1.to_ne_bytes();\n    let offset \u003d bytes.len() - word.len();\n    word.clone_from_slices(\u0026bytes[offset..]);\n}\nif let Some(word) \u003d words.next() {\n    let bytes \u003d r0.to_ne_bytes();\n    let offset \u003d bytes.len() - word.len();\n    word.clone_from_slices(\u0026bytes[offset..]);\n}\n```\n?",
      "parentUuid": "e0586772_52f4f36f",
      "revId": "186ed77a51aa0e8fe0e2fc33af1e12ebc8e8ab7e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
